+Find a projective point P represented by one row p=(p_0,...,p_{{d-1}}) over
+GF(q) such that:
+  1. P, P^sigma, ..., P^sigma^(d-4) all lie in Gamma;
+  2. those d-3 coordinate rows are linearly independent over GF(q); and
