+        "of coordinates, whose finite geometric inverse exposes the first point "
+        "of the Frobenius-orbit chain."
+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: generic recovery is nullspace elimination on 2(d-3) by d "
+        "over GF(q), O(d^3) field operations; at shipping d=97 it averaged "
+        "24,678 field operations and 0.021 seconds over eight seeds, while the "
+        "circulant geometric identity takes at most 204 exact operations."
+    ),
+    "max_answer_tokens": 144,
+}
+
+NATIVE: dict = {
