 ## Caveats
 
-- This family is deliberately easy for a computer with modular elimination; its claim is only Track B.  The 0.021-second mean reference time is evidence of that honesty, not Track-A hardness.
-- The generated vertices have equations over the distinguished base field and one binomial circulant disguise.  They do not sample arbitrary vertices over \(GF(q^d)\).
